            "date": "2026-10-18T02:32:22Z"
          },
          "message": "fix(cli): harden `h3 docs` page handling\n\n- Only open URLs whose origin is `https://h3.dev` (rejects absolute URLs,\n  `file:`/`javascript:`, `//host`, `\\\\host`, whitespace-prefixed hosts).\n- On Windows, open via `rundll32 url.dll,FileProtocolHandler` (absolute\n  System32 path) instead of `cmd /c start`, so cmd.exe metacharacters in\n  the page (`&`, `|`, `%VAR%`) can no longer inject commands.\n- Strip userinfo and collapse repeated slashes in the path.",
          "tree": {
            "sha": "8868dc53766c37c5b5a1dac1d5325281691715f6",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/h3js/h3/git/trees/8868dc53766c37c5b5a1dac1d5325281691715f6"
